The radio protocols and codeplug memory maps in this crate were written from qdmr, which is the
only specification these formats have. The AnyTone AT-D890UV channel element differs from qdmr's
second-generation map on firmware V100 and was re-derived from a radio; the rest of that map, the
AnyTone serial protocol, the Radtel RT-4D protocol and its codeplug banks follow qdmr.

